{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31Become the gardener of your own little paradise! In Grow Your Garden, you'll tend a piece of land and transform it into a blooming oasis. Sow seeds, water plants, discover new varieties, and watch your world become more vibrant with each passing day. Grow vegetables, flowers, or even magical plants\u2014each with its own characteristics and needs. Meet friendly animals, battle weeds, and experience the changing seasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb4 Plant cultivation: Choose from dozens of seeds and design your own garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26c5 Dynamic weather system: Sun, rain and seasons influence your growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 Mini-games &amp; tasks: Weeding, fertilizing, harvesting \u2013 playful gardening with fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc26 Friends &amp; visitors: Animals and neighbors bring life to your garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 Unlocks: Discover new plant species, tools, and garden decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3c Who is this game for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for anyone who enjoys games like Stardew Valley, Terraria, or Animal Crossing\u2014or just wants to relax and watch something grow.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039960?t=1759256723","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039960?t=1759256723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039960/7b5863ad06c3e6818a02dabf194b7c5fee4c8dce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759256723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.ste